### PIN Management Test Endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Register a user (if not already registered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testpin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phoneNumber": "+5511999999999"
}

### 2. Confirm via SMS (use the code from SMS)
# First, check the logs for the confirmation code sent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/confirm-sms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testpin@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

