### 3. Set PIN (4 digits only, requires JWT token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/set-pin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "pin": "1234"
}

### 4. Validate PIN (requires JWT token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate-pin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "pin": "1234"
}

### 5. Validate PIN with wrong code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate-pin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "pin": "9999"
}
